+# Aegis — Production Gates Finalization Patch
+
+This patch implements automation and enforcement scaffolding to close critical production gates:
+
+- HSM & Key custody: Terraform skeleton, mount + PKCS#11 helper, dual‑control activation helper, Vault signing test script.
+- Rekor durability: automated restore + RTO measurement, TLS rotation helper with cert-manager guidance.
+- Legal/vendor: CI helper to register DPAs/BYOK in dpa_registry_service and an enforcement check used before vendor calls.
+- Pentest process: import & block script, remediation tracker, and CI workflow to block AUTO when critical/high findings exist.
+- Simulator & shadow: enhanced shadow-run harness producing verifier metrics and CSV/JSON reports (suitable for 10k–100k runs).
+- Scale & reliability: Karpenter tuning profile, scale runner and collection scripts to measure provisioning latency and Kafka DLQ load tests.
+- Observability & SLOs: instrumentation helper to persist trace_id into evidence, tests to validate tracing + evidence correlation, and SLO runbook tied to kill-switch.
+- Governance & Runbooks: dual-control enable script with gate checks, on‑call runbook, production activation checklist references.
